OL,3,GNEWSA'I get emotional thinking I'll be
OL,4,Aoff the streets'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun to try to meet the Prime
OL,7,FMinister's pledge to offer all rough
OL,8,Fsleepers a route off the streets before
OL,9,FChristmas.
OL,11,FAndy Burnham made the promise on his
OL,12,Ffirst day in the job and the government
OL,13,Fhas since allocated more than #12m to
OL,14,Fthe West of England Combined Authority
OL,15,Fto tackle homelessness over the next
OL,16,Fthree years.
OL,18,FIn Bristol, the number of people
OL,19,Fsleeping rough has increased steadily
OL,20,Fsince Covid, with the council's monthly
OL,21,Fstreet count now approaching the
OL,22,Fhighest-ever recorded.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
