OL,3,GNEWSA'I get emotional thinking I'll be
OL,4,Aoff the streets'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne charity said it was "confident"
OL,7,Faccommodation could be found for
OL,8,Feveryone currently in need but that
OL,9,Flong-term success would depend on
OL,10,Fmaking sure the right support and
OL,11,Fhousing was available.
